: α) → (β k → β k) → Std.DTreeMap.Internal.Impl.{u, v} α β → Std.DTreeMap.Internal.Impl.{u, v} α β","unsafe":false,"value":181,"source":{"code":"/-- Internal implementation detail of the tree map -/\n@[specialize]\ndef modify [Ord α] [LawfulEqOrd α] (k : α) (f : β k → β k) (t : Impl α β) :\n    Impl α β :=\n  match t with\n  | .leaf => .leaf\n  | .inner sz k' v' l r =>\n    match h : compare k k' with\n    | .lt => .inner sz k' v' (modify k f l) r\n    | .gt => .inner sz k' v' l (modify k f r)\n    | .eq => .inner sz k (f <| cast (congrArg β <| compare_eq_iff_eq.mp h).symm v') l r","start":823,"end":833},"axioms":[]}